OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after masked man
OL,4,Atried to fire crossbow at PSNI station
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed response units were deployed
OL,7,Falongside local policing officers after
OL,8,Fa man was seen brandishing a crossbow
OL,9,Fin Belfast city centre.
OL,11,FPolice said the incident in Durham
OL,12,FStreet was reported at about 02:40 GMT
OL,13,Fon Friday, but "the suspect had fled
OL,14,Fthe area prior to their arrival".
OL,16,FThey said that the crossbow has since
OL,17,Fbeen recovered along with a crossbow
OL,18,Fbolt and a face covering.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
