OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after masked man
OL,4,Atried to fire crossbow at PSNI station
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt "would appear an attempt was made to
OL,7,Fdischarge the bolt at the police
OL,8,Fstation on Grosvenor Road", the Police
OL,9,FService of Northern Ireland (PSNI)
OL,10,Fadded.
